 74   805F 21 B6 83             LD      HL,MsgReadbackPass
 75   8062 CD 4A 82             CALL    DebugPrint
 76   8065
 77   8065 CD 0D 81             CALL    RunPackedModeSweep
 78   8068
 79   8068 21 E0 83             LD      HL,MsgReady
 80   806B CD 4A 82             CALL    DebugPrint
