220   810D              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
221   810D              ; Sweep every packed-pixel mode accepted by the Project131 1 MiB adapter.
222   810D              ; Supported combinations are taken from docs/ISA_VGA_Adapter.md.
223   810D              ; Each mode is selected, the entire 1 MiB aperture is written, then held
224   810D              ; briefly so the VGA window can be inspected before advancing.
225   810D              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
